                                    The whole guild is now searching for that
                                    thieving [CS:N]Grovyle[CR].
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="[CS:N]Bidoof[CR], [CS:N]Dugtrio[CR], and I searched [CS:P]Crystal Cave[CR].",
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="But our search turned up nothing.",
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="Where could that [CS:N]Grovyle[CR] be...?",
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="But he must be caught, no matter what!",
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="For [CS:N]Uxie[CR]'s sake too, we'll catch that criminal!",
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    P.S. That silly [CS:N]Bidoof[CR]...[K] Oh my gosh, he was
                                    no help looking for [CS:N]Grovyle[CR]...
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    Not only that, he even brought home a crystal
                                    as a souvenir! Eeek!
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    That reminds me...[K] When we were leaving
                                    [CS:P]Crystal Cave[CR], I caught [CS:N]Bidoof[CR] grinning to
                                    himself...
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    Now that I think about it... Oh my gosh, that
