                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    He was leaving some of his dinner for
                                    [hero]'s team.
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="Then (oh my gosh!) the others noticed too.",
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    So we all did what [CS:N]Bidoof[CR] was doing. We left
                                    bits and pieces of our dinner.[K] (Though [CS:N]Loudred[CR]
                                    agonized over the decision to the end.)
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    Yippee! Everyone pitched in to help! How sweet
                                    of them! Oh my gosh, I am getting emotional!
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    In the end, we decided to share the smaller
                                    things ourselves and leave them with one
                                    whole [CS:I]Apple[CR] each!
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    [CS:N]Chimecho[CR], [CS:N]Bidoof[CR], and I will keep those two
                                    [CS:I]Apples[CR] for the night.
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    Tomorrow morning, we'll give them to Team
                                    [team:].
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    They must be hungry now, but they have to
                                    endure it just a little longer...
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    We all have to stick together and try to make
                                    it into the expedition party!
                                """,
                            });
                            jump @label_1;
                        case 7:
